{
  "id": "09_chinook_flight_a",
  "title": "Maiden Flight: Responsive Controls & Cruising",
  "label": "支奴干起飞",
  "duration": 32.7,
  "voice_timing": [
    {
      "start": 0.2,
      "duration": 7.91,
      "text": "Hit the throttle, and the helicopter lifts off smoothly from the grass into a clean vertical climb! Nudging forward input pitches the nose down as thrust propels us forward.",
      "source": "modules/09_chinook_flight_a/audio/a5bbce4ba8c04026a47e.wav"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.36,
      "duration": 11.84,
      "text": "Releasing the keys commands the controller to decelerate and settle into a stable hover. Our first turn is wide and deliberate: a heavy tandem transport should feel substantial, carrying realistic momentum and weight rather than feeling twitchy.",
      "source": "modules/09_chinook_flight_a/audio/effafce6192cc3f0c869.wav"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.45,
      "duration": 11.87,
      "text": "As the castle slips behind us, sunlight cuts across the skyward ring, revealing an incredible panoramic skyline. Testing each axis one at a time lets you appreciate just how responsive and natural the handling feels.",
      "source": "modules/09_chinook_flight_a/audio/d9cd3ec0c8ee2cd4a12a.wav"
    }
  ],
